<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Paige McManus | Personal Website</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      color: #24211e;
      background: #f6f2ec;
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    body { margin: 0; line-height: 1.6; }

    header, main, footer {
      width: min(100% - 2rem, 960px);
      margin: auto;
    }

    header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 1rem;
      padding: 1.25rem 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #d9d0c5;
    }

    .name { font-weight: bold; }

    nav {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    a { color: #80432f; }
    nav a { text-decoration: none; }
    nav a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

    section { padding: 3.5rem 0; scroll-margin-top: 1rem; }
    h1 { font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 8vw, 5rem); line-height: 1; margin: 0 0 1rem; }
    h2 { font-size: 2rem; }
    .intro { max-width: 620px; font-size: 1.15rem; }

    .hero {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    figure { margin: 0; }
    .concept-image {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      height: auto;
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: #dfb99c;
    }

    figcaption { color: #625b55; font-size: 0.85rem; margin-top: 0.5rem; }

    .project, .interest-list {
      background: #fff;
      border: 1px solid #e5ddd3;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 1.25rem;
    }

    .interest-list { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem; }
    .interest-list span { background: #f3e8dc; border-radius: 20px; padding: 0.4rem 0.8rem; }

    .social-links { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem; }

    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
      border-radius: 6px;
      background: #80432f;
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .button:hover { background: #5f3022; }

    footer {
      border-top: 1px solid #d9d0c5;
      padding: 1.5rem 0;
      color: #625b55;
    }

    @media (max-width: 650px) {
      header { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; }
      .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      section { padding: 2.5rem 0; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <a class="name" href="#top">Paige McManus</a>
    <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
      <a href="#about">About</a>
      <a href="#projects">Projects</a>
      <a href="#interests">Interests</a>
      <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main id="top">
    <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="page-title">
      <div>
        <p>Student · Marketing research · Consumer insights</p>
        <h1 id="page-title">Ideas into insight.</h1>
        <p class="intro">
          I’m Paige. I’m interested in how people make everyday choices and
          how research can help shape better ideas.
        </p>
      </div>

      <figure>
        <!-- This original SVG illustration is embedded in the page, so it
             does not need a separate image file to display on GitHub Pages. -->
        <svg class="concept-image" viewBox="0 0 600 520"
             role="img" aria-labelledby="image-title image-description"
             xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
          <title id="image-title">SealSkin concept illustration</title>
          <desc id="image-description">
            A mock product card for the proposed SealSkin concept, with a
            translucent shape representing flexible film.
          </desc>
          <rect width="600" height="520" rx="18" fill="#dfb99c"/>
          <circle cx="490" cy="105" r="58" fill="#f3d08a"/>
          <path d="M0 390 Q160 320 300 390 T600 365 V520 H0Z" fill="#ba8063" opacity=".55"/>
          <rect x="180" y="80" width="245" height="330" rx="16" fill="#f8f3eb"/>
          <text x="210" y="145" font-family="Arial,sans-serif" font-size="14" letter-spacing="3" fill="#6a5145">CONCEPT STUDY</text>
          <text x="210" y="220" font-family="Arial,sans-serif" font-size="40" font-weight="bold" fill="#30231f">SealSkin</text>
          <text x="210" y="255" font-family="Arial,sans-serif" font-size="14" letter-spacing="1" fill="#6a5145">A SECOND-SKIN IDEA</text>
          <path d="M205 287 H395" stroke="#c77a59" stroke-width="2"/>
          <text x="210" y="321" font-family="Arial,sans-serif" font-size="13" fill="#6a5145">PROPOSED PRODUCT</text>
          <text x="210" y="345" font-family="Arial,sans-serif" font-size="13" fill="#6a5145">NOT A TESTED PRODUCT</text>
          <path d="M65 345 Q95 255 135 290 Q155 310 125 350 Q108 375 145 392 Q180 408 150 435 Q115 462 70 430 Q40 408 65 345Z"
                fill="#fff" fill-opacity=".55" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="3"/>
        </svg>
        <figcaption>SealSkin concept illustration · visual mockup</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </section>

    <section id="about">
      <h2>About me</h2>
      <p>
        I’m a student interested in marketing, consumer insights, and the
        stories behind everyday decisions. I enjoy turning questions into
        research plans and communicating what the evidence can—and cannot—show.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section id="projects">
      <h2>Featured project: SealSkin</h2>
      <div class="project">
        <p>
          SealSkin is a proposed clear, flexible liquid barrier for small cuts
          and nicks. I explored how active young adults might respond to the
          concept through an AI-simulated focus group.
        </p>
        <p>
          The discussion raised questions about staying in place during
          activity, cleanup, price, and trust compared with familiar options.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Research note:</strong> These are tentative themes from
          fictional AI participants, not findings from real consumers or
          product testing. They do not establish product safety or effectiveness.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="interests">
      <h2>Interests</h2>
      <div class="interest-list">
        <span>Consumer behavior</span>
        <span>Marketing research</span>
        <span>Product ideas</span>
        <span>Clear communication</span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="contact">
      <h2>Connect with me</h2>
      <p>Visit my profiles:</p>
      <div class="social-links">
        <a class="button"
           href="https://github.com/paigemcmanus-byte/paigemcmanus-byte.github.io"
           target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>
        <a class="button"
           href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/paige-mcmanus-275a452b1/"
           target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <a href="#top">Back to top</a>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
